&lt;p&gt;I have an &lt;a href="http://localhost:1313/piaware-lcd-display/"&gt;ADS-B node&lt;/a&gt; feeding data into the vast network of flight trackers, but it mostly just sits on my roof humming along without any interaction from me. I can, and have, looked at the webpage that shows my local flight data and the planes on a map, but it didn’t quite have the whimsy I was after. I decided a wall-mounted device that displayed the aircraft type closest to my location at any given moment would be a fun build.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>